whyred-metal

Adreno 509 GPU bring-up for the Redmi Note 5 (whyred, SDM636) on ios-whyred.

Architecture reference:
  https://github.com/oosexgang/hakios-xnu-kernel

Licenses of the upstream material:
  kernel/   APSL 2.0, derivative of XNU and the hakios drivers/gpu code
  userland/ MIT, including Mesa's a5xx.xml and adreno_pm4.xml (MIT) and hakios-metal (MIT)
  docs/     MIT, except where a document names another license
  tools/    MIT

No Apple binaries, firmware images or Qualcomm blobs are distributed here. Firmware is read from the
user's own stock ROM.
